      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "用户发消息\n  ↓\n保存 user message\n  ↓\nSearchKnowledge(query)\n  ↓\n有证据：rag+rule 回复 + evidence_ids\n无证据：NO_EVIDENCE_FALLBACK + knowledge_gap\n高风险：TRANSFER_THRESHOLD + transfer_ticket\n  ↓\n更新 conversation 状态\n  ↓\n控制台展示证据、缺口、规则和工单",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "用户发消息\n  ↓\n保存 user message\n  ↓\nSearchKnowledge(query)\n  ↓\n有证据：rag+rule 回复 + evidence_ids\n无证据：NO_EVIDENCE_FALLBACK + knowledge_gap\n高风险：TRANSFER_THRESHOLD + transfer_ticket\n  ↓\n更新 conversation 状态\n  ↓\n控制台展示证据、缺口、规则和工单",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
